loods the room eventually Lee knocks  the sunglasses off abdul-jabbar's face  leaving him defenseless as Lee locks in  a chokehold check out one of our newest  videos right here plus even more looper  videos about your favorite movies are  coming soon subscribe to our YouTube  channel and hit the belt so you don't  miss a single one  you

